            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-mt-shw-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>This customer has had a lot of power cuts over the past few years, so decided to take matters into their own hands by getting us to install a changeover switch to allow them to plug in a generator when the power goes out.</p><p>If you want to get your home winter ready - <a href="/contact">contact us</a> today.</p></div>
